msgid "Sale order lines of this product are automatically declared fully invoiced, whatever the invoiced quantity is.\n"
"Use this policy for products whose amount is evaluated again at invoice level, i.e. the environmental contribution (CONAI), so the order is not kept open waiting for an invoice which will never match the ordered quantity."
msgstr ""

